# LLM machine exports (`.llm/exports/*`)

- Source of truth: `.cursor/`, `.cursorrules`. The **`llm-exports-sync`** GitHub Action (push to **`develop`**, or `workflow_dispatch`) runs the deterministic export, then updates branch **`llm`**, and the **`peter-evans/create-pull-request`** action opens or updates a PR from **`llm`** into **`develop`**. The workflow uses `git add -f` of ignored export paths on the runner only. Do not mirror that with local hand-commits; generated trees stay **gitignored** for normal work.
- **Do not** hand-commit generated paths (`skills/`, `instructions/`, per-target `copilot-instructions.md`) except allowlisted files (e.g. target `.gitkeep`); they are under ignore rules. See the **`llm-cursor-source`** and **`llm-exports-scripts`** skills and [`.llm/exports/README.md`](../../.llm/exports/README.md).
- When editing files under `scripts/llm/**`, follow the **`llm-exports-scripts`** skill.
